            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "collegechef08"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very good, I had this as a dip with chips first and then added some lime juice and 1/2 extra avocado to make as a dressing for a bean salad. Went over very well with the family and I've no doubt will be a tasty taco topping. Thanks for sharing!",
            "datePublished": "2013-08-11T09:59:47.110Z"
