            },
            "reviewBody": "Amazingly good. The tomatillos I had were pretty large, so I only put in 5 to 2 avocados. I also only used 2 serrano peppers, but I threw them in whole without de-seeding them. I added a clove of garlic and boy, was this yummy!",
